    "created_at": "2020-01-15T16:24:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-01-15T16:24:34Z",
    "body": "I think `appendChild()` still has some uses due to its return value. But yeah, things with constructors or clear better alternatives can probably be marked as such (and we should make sure to not have domintro boxes for historical things).",
